                                            problems. You will practice machine learning, learn tools for changing and
                                            analyzing data, and understand basic data mining. You will also learn how to
                                            create simple visuals and improve results using optimization techniques. By the
                                            end, you will be ready to use common tools and technologies used in Data Science
                                            and Machine Learning.
