                                Roorkee</span>
                        </h2>
                        <p class="fs-6 text-start text-italic  fst-italic lh-sm">Designed to bridge theoretical knowledge
                            with practical application, this program offers immersive learning with hands-on training,
                            interactive sessions with E&ICT Academy, IIT Roorkee faculty, and exposure to contemporary
                            analytics and
                            generative AI practices.</p>
